OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F106A1790389448
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AOpenAI bots meddled with multiple US
OL,4,Agovernment agency sites
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile some of the activity was due to
OL,7,Fthe AI tools working to find
OL,8,F"authoritative sources of public
OL,9,Finformation", some went beyond that
OL,10,Fwith bots getting around security
OL,11,Fmeasures on websites.
OL,13,FWhen attempting to get information from
OL,14,Fthe Census Bureau, for instance, AI
OL,15,Fagents used tools reserved for software
OL,16,Fdevelopers to access it.
